# Infra & CI/CD

Deep reference: [`docs/ci-cd.md`](../../docs/ci-cd.md). Develop env notes: [`infra/envs/develop/README.md`](../../infra/envs/develop/README.md).

## Commands

- Plan / apply / validate: `task infra:plan|apply|validate ENV=…`
- Deploy: `task api:deploy`, `task web:deploy`, `task admin:deploy` (web/admin after API in CI).
- Secrets to SSM: `task api:secrets:push ENV=…` (not Terraform).

## Conventions

- Remote state in S3; do not rely on local-only `terraform.tfstate` for shared work.
- GitHub Actions assumes AWS via OIDC; trust `repository` + `environment:*` claims (see ci-cd docs) — GitHub `sub` embeds owner/repo IDs.
- Workflow jobs should call **Task**, not duplicate shell orchestration.
- Path filters skip unchanged apps; `workflow_dispatch` force-deploys all for the chosen env.
- `infra:validate` uses `terraform init -backend=false` so hooks/CI work without AWS credentials.
